    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/f46eb2ac7cb42a41712562fbcf98a71b.avif?t=1747376402\" data-has-big width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has sent Hel, Goddess of Death, a mysterious request: to bring the gods down to Helheim, the realm of the dead. As Modgunn, guardian of the bridge between life and death and Hel\u2019s loyal subject, you must set out on a near-impossible mission to find and fight the Norse gods and set Ragnarok, the end of times, in motion. Meanwhile, Hel is busy preparing a party for the big family reunion\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/8e96dd9fccaac4f5772fe1f75d56c500.avif?t=1747376402\" width=800 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.poster.avif?t=1747376402\" width=640 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.webm?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.mp4?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade unique weapons as you battle your way from the depths of Hel to the glorious realm of Asgard at the top of Yggdrasil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock magical runes that change the battlefield and turn the tide of any fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Helheim with morbid decorations, wacky guests, and party items that boost your stats and reveal a wild comedic plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new strategies and combos to make every run a fresh and exciting experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBINE, KILL, DIE\u2026 AND TRY AGAIN! FROM HEL TO ASGARD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.poster.avif?t=1747376402\" width=640 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.webm?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.mp4?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/f46eb2ac7cb42a41712562fbcf98a71b.avif?t=1747376402\" data-has-big width=800 height=534 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has sent Hel, Goddess of Death, a mysterious request: to bring the gods down to Helheim, the realm of the dead. As Modgunn, guardian of the bridge between life and death and Hel\u2019s loyal subject, you must set out on a near-impossible mission to find and fight the Norse gods and set Ragnarok, the end of times, in motion. Meanwhile, Hel is busy preparing a party for the big family reunion\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/8e96dd9fccaac4f5772fe1f75d56c500.avif?t=1747376402\" width=800 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.poster.avif?t=1747376402\" width=640 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.webm?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/272b66ec2fa24c35520994acfd298360.mp4?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade unique weapons as you battle your way from the depths of Hel to the glorious realm of Asgard at the top of Yggdrasil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock magical runes that change the battlefield and turn the tide of any fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Helheim with morbid decorations, wacky guests, and party items that boost your stats and reveal a wild comedic plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with new strategies and combos to make every run a fresh and exciting experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBINE, KILL, DIE\u2026 AND TRY AGAIN! FROM HEL TO ASGARD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.poster.avif?t=1747376402\" width=640 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.webm?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430620/extras/95072dbf4679cf5ab916bfa3aea47e63.mp4?t=1747376402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "From Hel to Asgard is a turn-based, merge-puzzle roguelite where you battle enemies by combining weapons to unleash powerful attack combos. Unlock magical runes, upgrade your character with each run, and face off against legendary gods and heroes from Norse mythology as you pave the way to Ragnarok!",
